  "question": {
    "text": "The standard Gibbs free energy change $\\left(\\Delta G^{o}\\right)$ at $25^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}$ for the dissociation of $\\mathrm{N}_{2} \\mathrm{O}_{4}(\\mathrm{g})$ to $\\mathrm{NO}_{2}(g)$ is (given, equilibrium constant $=0.15, R=8.314 \\mathrm{JK} / \\mathrm{mol})$"
